# Chicago Crime Analysis Project - Git Ignore File
# Protects sensitive data and development artifacts

# =====================================================
# SENSITIVE DATA - NEVER COMMIT THESE!
# =====================================================

# Environment Variables & API Keys
.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.test
.env.production
.env.*

# Terraform State Files (contain sensitive data)
